dition] [Repair Facility ID] : [Identifier for the Repair Facility] [Repair Order Number] : [Repair order number from the repair facility] [Resale Certificate ID] : [Resale certificate number (e.g., salvage buyer)] [RI] : [Representative Identification] [Social Security Number] : [Social Security Number of person] [State License Number] : [State License Number] [State Tax Exempt] : [State Tax Exempt Number] [Stock Number] : [Stock number for fleet vehicle, Or Stock or Lot number for Salvage Location] [TI] : [Taxpayer Identification] [TowInd] : [Tow Indicator] [US] : [Unique Supplier Identification Number (USIN)] [User ID] : [Identifier of the user] [UserID] : [Identifier of the user] [Vehicle Tracking Number] : [Tracking Number for Vehicle] [Vendor ID] : [Vendor ID] [WAGroupID] : [Work Assignment Group Identification] [Yard Location] : [Yard Location identifier]",
              "enum": [
                "Account Number",
